    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A Wonderful Opportunity to Own Your First Home in Mullingar\r\n\r\n3 Bedroom Semi-Detached House | Excellent Condition | Quiet Residential Location\r\n\r\nNo. 106 Ashfield presents an excellent opportunity for a first-time buyer seeking a comfortable, well-maintained home in a convenient location close to Mullingar town.\r\n\r\nThis attractive three-bedroom semi-detached property is presented in immaculate condition. With bright, well-proportioned accommodation, a large rear garden and the added benefit of a side entrance, this is a home that is ready to move into and enjoy.\r\n\r\nThe property overlooks a pleasant green area, creating a peaceful setting while remaining within easy reach of the many amenities Mullingar has to offer.\r\n\r\nLOCATION, CONVENIENCE & LIFESTYLE\r\n\r\nOne of the key attractions of No. 106 Ashfield is its excellent location.\r\nThe property is situated close to Mullingar Town Centre, with Tesco Shopping Centre and a wide range of shops, services, schools, restaurants and other amenities all within easy reach.\r\nFor a first-time buyer, the combination of a quiet residential setting and convenient access to the town makes this an appealing place to put down roots.\r\n\r\n\r\nA HOME READY TO MOVE INTO\r\n\r\nThe ground floor accommodation includes a welcoming entrance hall, a generous sitting room with bay window and open fireplace, and a bright kitchen/diner with patio doors opening onto the rear garden.\r\nUpstairs are three bedrooms, including a main bedroom with built-in wardrobes and ensuite, together with a family bathroom."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\n4.36m x 1.75m\r\nTimber flooring and telephone point.\r\n\r\nSitting Room\r\n5.20m x 3.36m\r\nA bright and welcoming reception room featuring timber flooring, bay windows, TV point and an open fireplace. French doors provide access to the kitchen/diner.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Diner\r\n5.40m x 3.36m\r\nFitted kitchen units, oven and hotplate, washing machine and fridge freezer. Tiled flooring and patio doors lead directly to the rear garden, making this an ideal space for everyday family living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nGuest WC\r\n1.41m x 0.75m\r\nWC and wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nLanding\r\n3.09m x 2.09m\r\nFitted carpet.\r\n\r\nMain Bedroom\r\n4.52m x 2.86m\r\nA spacious main bedroom with timber flooring, built-in wardrobe, telephone and TV points, together with a bay window.\r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\n2.59m x 0.77m\r\nTiled walls and floor, WC, power shower and vanity unit.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.39m x 3.37m\r\nTimber flooring and built-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n2.53m x 2.45m\r\nTimber flooring and built-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\r\n2.08m x 1.75m\r\nFully tiled walls and floor, WC, wash hand basin, bath, electric shower and vanity unit.\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE\r\nThe property enjoys a large rear garden with steel garden shed, providing valuable outdoor space for gardening, relaxing or entertaining.\r\nThe side entrance adds further practicality, while the front of the property overlooks a pleasant green area.\r\n\r\nPresented in immaculate condition, allowing the new owner to settle in with minimal work required.\r\nExcellent Location\r\nClose to Mullingar Town Centre, Tesco Shopping Centre and a wide range of local amenities.\r\nPeaceful Setting\r\nEnjoy the benefit of overlooking a green area while remaining close to the convenience of town.\r\nGreat Outdoor Space\r\nA large rear garden and side entrance provide excellent additional space and practicality.\r\n\r\nVIEWING HIGHLY RECOMMENDED\r\n\r\nNo. 106 Ashfield represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-maintained, three-bedroom semi-detached home in a convenient and established Mullingar location.\r\n\r\nWith its attractive presentation, generous accommodation, private rear garden and proximity to Mullingar town, this property is ideally suited to those looking to take their first step onto the property ladder."
      },
